    "name": "-Ham Cafe- Ohamu Shokudo Ki",
    "steam_appid": 3611940,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-Ham Cafe- Ohamu Shokudo Ki]\u00a0is a diner management simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You manage a diner by collecting ingredients from farms and exploring, and developing dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create delicious dishes to satisfy your customers and create your ideal diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc39 Game Features\ud83e\udd55 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Gather ingredients and prepare food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ingredients from exploring and farming, develop dishes, and add them to the cafeteria menu. Add your favorite menu items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Decide on the menu and manage the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, quickly serve the food. Serve food at a fast pace and keep your customers satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Manage your farm &amp; ranch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow vegetables in the fields and harvest by-products such as milk and eggs from animals. Obtain essential ingredients for your diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Rogue-like exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map in a simplified roguelike style, collecting ingredients through random events and battles with wild animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Dining room customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the dining room to your liking by changing the furniture and interior design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to do game commentary and video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the video description.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[-Ham Cafe- Ohamu Shokudo Ki]\u00a0is a diner management simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You manage a diner by collecting ingredients from farms and exploring, and developing dishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create delicious dishes to satisfy your customers and create your ideal diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc39 Game Features\ud83e\udd55 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Gather ingredients and prepare food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ingredients from exploring and farming, develop dishes, and add them to the cafeteria menu. Add your favorite menu items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Decide on the menu and manage the diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you receive an order, quickly serve the food. Serve food at a fast pace and keep your customers satisfied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Manage your farm &amp; ranch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow vegetables in the fields and harvest by-products such as milk and eggs from animals. Obtain essential ingredients for your diner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Rogue-like exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map in a simplified roguelike style, collecting ingredients through random events and battles with wild animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd38 Dining room customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate the dining room to your liking by changing the furniture and interior design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also free to do game commentary and video streaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would appreciate it if you could include a link to your Steam store page in the video description.</p>",
    "short_description": "[-Ham Cafe- Ohamu Shokudo Ki] is a diner management simulation.You manage a diner by collecting ingredients from farms and exploring, and developing dishes.Create delicious dishes to satisfy your customers and create your ideal diner.",
